{"id":4052,"chapter_id":4,"scene_id":405,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"海拉","content":"好凶猛的家伙，这*文明*是个迷你卓娅呀！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052001"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"别后退，她的力量远没到卓娅的级别，还带着伤，我们能解决她。","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"海拉","content":"可她的战斗经验不是街头混混能比的，而且那种不要命的打法……我连一斧头都扛不住。","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"海拉","content":"这果然是个熊精吧，会变形成人的熊精，长得矮完全是用来迷惑对手的吧！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"话音未落，海拉就被斧背击飞。赫卡蒂立刻拦在你身前。","style":3,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"你就是她们的头？又从哪儿掳来新的禁闭者逼着战斗了？！你们打不赢卓娅，就用这种下作手段！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"卑鄙的家伙、黑帮混蛋们，就凭你们也想算计军团，算计我老大？！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"是狂厄的影响吗？她的精神过于亢奋，但现在还有挽回的可能。","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052008"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"我来对付她，局长找机会使用枷锁。要尽快！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"滚开——！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"巨斧震地，击退了梦魇，赫罗的气势几乎将所有人压倒。那是坚定不移的战意，是对军团和卓娅的绝对忠诚。","style":3,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"这样的人即使被击败、套上枷锁，也不可能对你屈服。既然如此，你决定换一种做法——","style":3,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"options":["别打了，我们都是卓娅的人！"],"jump":[14],"style":6,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"？！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"赫卡蒂&海拉","content":"？！！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局——","voice":["vo_cgplot_4052016"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_04","style":1,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"你冲上前一步，将赫卡蒂护在身后，顺势打断了她的话。","style":3,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"赫罗的巨斧滞留在半空，你看着她的眼睛，慢慢说到。","style":3,"background":402,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我们是辛迪加自由人，雇佣兵。受军团所托，下来救你。","style":2,"background":402,"log_type":1}]}